    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 20, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我和蕾雅为了找到典狱长，<br>\n穿过森林，朝着湖的方向走去。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 23, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_156", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 25, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这时，我们听到湖的方向传来水花四溅的声音。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 27, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Surprised"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 29, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "湖那边有动静……！", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Leia001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 31, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 33, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啊，那也许就是典狱长。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Hiro001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 35, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "听到水声后，我们加快脚步，<br>\n但迎接我们的却是意想不到的人物。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 41, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 43, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": [0.75], "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [95.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Miria.Surprised1,ArmR10"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.2"}},
    {"op": "EmoteJump", "line": 45, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["Miria"], "Loop": 0, "Speed": 1.0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.4"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 47, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [120.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Miria"}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 48, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.20000000298023224, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 49, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.2"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "小蕾，还有小希！？<br>\n哇啊啊啊～", "AuthorId": "Miria", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Miria001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "正在湖中洗澡的米莉亚慌乱不已，<br>\n连忙躲到树荫下。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "吓、吓吓吓死我了……！<br>\n没想到居然会有人来……", "AuthorId": "Miria", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Miria002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "既然你是穿着衣服下水的，<br>\n我是觉得没有必要躲起来……", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Hiro002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不、不是啦，明明是个大叔，还在湖里玩闹，<br>\n这幅样子被看到了，有点害羞……", "AuthorId": "Miria", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Miria003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你可不是大叔吧？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Hiro003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 65, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "虽然不是真的大叔啦……<br>\n不对，不是这个问题……", "AuthorId": "Miria", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Miria004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 67, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 70, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "算啦算啦，希罗。<br>\n展现出平时不曾示人的一面，<br>\n确实需要一点勇气。", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Leia002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不过，这真是出人意料啊。<br>\n米莉亚确实不像是会这么开心玩闹的人。<br>", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Leia003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 74, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……昨天和小莉一起玩了以后啊，<br>\n大叔我深刻体会到，<br>\n为了减轻精神压力，有时候换换心情真的很重要。", "AuthorId": "Miria", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Miria005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 76, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以偶尔在湖里痛快地游一场<br>\n也不错吧～？", "AuthorId": "Miria", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Miria006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 78, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "虽然我实在无法理解，<br>\n为何她敢踏入这片深不见底的诡异湖泊……", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 80, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "但我们都是受雪莉的影响而开始行动的，<br>\n这点不仅是米莉亚，我和蕾雅也一样。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 82, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "就在我这么想着的时候——", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 85, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_8", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 87, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 89, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "在湖对岸的稍远处，<br>\n能看见典狱长正在飞来。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 91, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "希罗！是典狱长！<br>\n我们追！", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Leia004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 93, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 95, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啊……看来只能上了。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Hiro004"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 98, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_145", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 105, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 106, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000", "Duration": 0.20000000298023224, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 108, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我们不得不跃入湖中。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 110, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "因为我们判断，游过去比绕路更快。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 112, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（湖水比想像中深……）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Hiro005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 114, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "幸好湖水干净清澈，<br>\n还不至于令人不适……", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative011"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 116, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "QuickSave", "line": 117, "indent": 0, "params": {"SlotNumber": 22, "Wait": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 119, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "然而，我隐约在水下<br>\n瞥见了一个诡异的影子。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 121, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（什么东西……？）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Hiro006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 123, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我——", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative013"]}},
    {"op": "AddChoice", "line": 125, "indent": 0, "params": {"ChoiceSummary": "跟在那个影子的后面", "Lock": 0, "ButtonPath": "ChoiceButtons/Adv/Bad", "AutoPlay": 1, "ShowHandler": 1}, "text_ids": {"ChoiceSummary": ["0204Adv05_Choice001"]}},
    {"op": "GotoModified", "line": 126, "indent": 1, "params": {"Path": "Act02_Chapter04/Act02_Chapter04_Bad02", "ResetState": ["-"]}},
    {"op": "AddChoice", "line": 128, "indent": 0, "params": {"ChoiceSummary": "无视了那个影子", "Lock": 0, "AutoPlay": 1, "ShowHandler": 1}, "text_ids": {"ChoiceSummary": ["0204Adv05_Choice002"]}},
    {"op": "GotoModified", "line": 129, "indent": 1, "params": {"Path": ".Choice2-4-2"}},
    {"op": "StopForChoice", "line": 131, "indent": 0, "params": {"Clear": 0}},
    {"op": "label", "name": "Choice2-4-2", "line": 133, "indent": 0},
    {"op": "RecordCorrectChoice", "line": 135, "indent": 0, "params": {"Number": 22}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 137, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "现在还是追典狱长比较重要。<br>\n我选择无视那个影子。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative014"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 139, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#00000000", "Duration": 0.8999999761581421, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor.Custom", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 141, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——然而，当我们游到对岸时，<br>\n典狱长早已消失无踪。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative015"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 145, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [20.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Angry1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 147, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "哈啊，哈啊，哈啊……可恶。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Hiro007"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 151, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 153, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "结果我们也全身湿透了啊……", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Leia005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 155, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "或许是好奇我们的举动，<br>\n米莉亚也游到了对岸。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative016"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 157, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [20.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 158, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 159, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": [1.0], "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Miria.Smile1,ArmR10"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 160, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 162, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "既然都湿透了……不如我们三个一起玩水，如何？", "AuthorId": "Miria", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Miria007"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 164, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 165, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 167, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "全身湿透的我们对视了一眼……", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative017"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 169, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 170, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 172, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "最终决定，<br>\n就当作稍事休息，尽情玩水吧。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative018"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 174, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 176, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "阳光透过树叶洒在湖面上，波光粼粼，<br>\n微小的涟漪随我们的动作扩散。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative019"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 178, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我们互相泼水……<br>\n自由游泳……<br>\n难得地尽情玩闹了一番。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative020"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 180, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "微风吹来青草的芳香，混合着湖水的清凉气息，<br>\n令人心旷神怡。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0204Adv05_Narrative021"]}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 187, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv"}},
